;
;     [EMIM][BF4] ionic liquid Topology File
;
;     BF4- anion AMBER Force Field Topology File
;
;     Parameters according to the original paper
;     de Andrade et. al. (2002) JPC B 106 p. 13344.
;     Modified according to Muller-Plathe 2007 and adjusted to fit the
;     experimental thermophysical data of the EMImBF4 ionic liquid at 298.15 K.
;     B parameters according to the original paper
;     de Andrade et. al. (2002) JPC B 106 p. 13344.
;     F parameters taken from OPLS-AA opls_965 perfluoralkanes
;     sigma=0.29500, epsilon=0.221752 and adjusted to fit the
;     experimental parameters of the EMImBF4 ionic liquid at 298.15 K.
;     Using Muller-Plathe F atom parameters.
;     
;     Boltzmann weighted RESP charges for [EMIM][BF4] ion pair.
;
;     References:
;
;     Zhao, W.; Eslami, H.; Cavalcanti, W. L.; Müller-Plathe, F. A Refined All-Atom Model for the Ionic
;     Liquid 1-n-Butyl 3-Methylimidazolium bis(Trifuoromethylsulfonyl)imide [bmim][Tf2N].
;     Z. Phys. Chem. 2007, 221, 1647-1662.
;     https://doi.org/10.1524/zpch.2007.221.11-12.1647
;
;     Elvis S. Böes, Caio L. Firme, Jones de Andrade, Hubert Stassen.
;     Thermophysical properties of [EMIM][BF4] and [EMIM][EtSO4]
;     mixtures with molecular solvents from a charge-transfer-informed
;     force field.
;     Journal of Chemical & Engineering Data 2026 xxxx xxxx.
;     https://doi.org/xxxx.xxxx
;
;     LAST UPDATED 31 AUG 2026.
;

